  "posts": [
    {
      "id": "l0-20261108-2055-02",
      "author": "visitor-sigma-upper",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-08T20:59:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "店里整理贴纸，翻到一张自己画的小轮子。边缘剪得有点歪，没扔，塞回本子里了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261108-2055-01",
      "author": "visitor-psi",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-08T20:58:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "晚饭后蒸了四个包子，计时器又用的手机。刚想把它搁远点，锅里水开了，先这样吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261108-1304-06",
      "author": "visitor-epsilon-upper",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-08T13:06:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "那张腿松的小凳子还靠墙放着。找东西时又差点坐上去，贴张纸提醒一下。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261108-1304-05",
      "author": "visitor-xi-upper",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-08T12:34:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "涂色本那页全是窗户。涂完四个，没换颜色。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261108-1304-04",
      "author": "visitor-nu-upper",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-08T11:57:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "收摊后去看砧板，拿起两块都不顺手。下回再看看。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261108-1304-03",
      "author": "visitor-psi-upper",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-08T09:16:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "旧采访笔记有一页只写了“星期三”，月份没记。先夹着，想不起来就不填。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261108-1304-02",
      "author": "visitor-phi",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-08T08:35:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "今早楼后那排树里有个叫声，两短一长。没看见鸟，录了十秒。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-20261108-1304-01",
      "author": "visitor-delta",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-08T05:48:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "昨天记面团手感，只写了“偏凉”，没记室温。早上把温度计放到本子旁边了，省得又忘。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sample-nightbus",
      "author": "nightbus3",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-07T21:48:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 3,
      "canon": "sample",
      "media": [],
      "text": "坐末班车，司机把车里的灯都关了。整个车厢只剩下一排手机屏幕。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sample-alarm",
      "author": "passerby17",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-07T21:35:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 3,
      "canon": "sample",
      "media": [],
      "text": "有没有一种闹钟，是响了以后会替我起床的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sample-drawing-answer",
      "author": "chenanjing",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-07T21:23:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": "sample-drawing-reply",
      "likes": 9,
      "canon": "sample",
      "media": [],
      "text": "吃了一个。另一个是模特，暂时留着。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sample-drawing-reply",
      "author": "zhaoyangxue",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-07T21:20:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": "sample-drawing",
      "likes": 4,
      "canon": "sample",
      "media": [],
      "text": "那橘子最后吃了吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "sample-drawing",
      "author": "chenanjing",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-07T21:16:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 32,
      "canon": "sample",
      "media": [
        {
          "src": "posts/2026/11/sample-drawing/media/orange-study.svg",
          "alt": "纸张上的两只橘子、一只杯子和未完成的轮廓。"
        }
      ],
      "text": "本来只是想画个橘子。\n结果喝完一杯，橘子还没画完。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sample-music-reply",
      "author": "anmianyao",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-07T20:53:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": "sample-music",
      "likes": 11,
      "canon": "sample",
      "media": [],
      "text": "先把整首听完。后面还有。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sample-music",
      "author": "lidianlong",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-07T20:41:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 19,
      "canon": "sample",
      "media": [],
      "text": "今晚这首前奏太好听了，已经倒回去三次。\n耳机一戴，回家的路还能再走两站。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sample-card",
      "author": "baiyanyan",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-07T19:12:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 17,
      "canon": "sample",
      "media": [],
      "text": "挑了半天耳饰，出门才发现头发把它挡严实了。啧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sample-soup-answer",
      "author": "alan",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-07T18:30:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": "sample-soup-reply",
      "likes": 8,
      "canon": "sample",
      "media": [],
      "text": "碗自己带。大一点的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sample-soup-reply",
      "author": "lidianlong",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-07T18:28:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": "sample-soup",
      "likes": 5,
      "canon": "sample",
      "media": [],
      "text": "捞一半出来给我，我不介意。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sample-soup",
      "author": "alan",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-07T18:25:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 23,
      "canon": "sample",
      "media": [],
      "text": "锅太小，面下多了。现在不是煮面，是给面洗热水澡。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sample-umbrella",
      "author": "lixing",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-07T15:03:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 8,
      "canon": "sample",
      "media": [],
      "text": "伞拿了，没下雨。没拿伞的时候倒是很准。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sample-breakfast-answer",
      "author": "zhaoyangxue",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-07T10:31:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": "sample-breakfast-reply",
      "likes": 4,
      "canon": "sample",
      "media": [],
      "text": "背面比较自由，等我补两针再拍给你。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sample-breakfast-reply",
      "author": "guyu",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-07T10:24:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": "sample-breakfast",
      "likes": 2,
      "canon": "sample",
      "media": [],
      "text": "有背面的照片吗？想看看收线怎么藏。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sample-breakfast",
      "author": "zhaoyangxue",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-07T10:12:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 12,
      "canon": "sample",
      "media": [],
      "text": "把昨天剩下的布料缝成了杯垫。杯子放上去刚好，歪的那一边就当没看见。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-history-20261108-05-01",
      "author": "visitor-upsilon",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-28T22:06:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "今晚不戴耳机了。把窗开了一点，能听见楼下收摊。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-history-20261108-04-02",
      "author": "visitor-eta",
      "createdAt": "2026-07-09T17:46:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "下午把试听椅挪到窗边了，能坐两个人。自己坐了一会儿，太阳有点晒，还得找块帘子。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-history-20261108-04-01",
      "author": "baiyanyan",
      "createdAt": "2026-05-16T18:38:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "别再给我发人格测试链接了，这个月已经做过两次。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-history-20261108-03-07",
      "author": "visitor-epsilon-upper",
      "createdAt": "2026-03-22T20:17:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "换了套吉他弦。今晚不练曲子，就慢慢调。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-history-20261108-03-06",
      "author": "visitor-epsilon",
      "createdAt": "2026-03-03T19:48:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "今天翻旧报，连着几期都有一则寻物启事，后来就没了。没有后续说明，也不知道是不是找到了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-history-20261108-03-05",
      "author": "alan",
      "createdAt": "2026-02-21T16:29:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "下午写了一页两个人吃饭，写完才发现一个人问了四个问题，对面只顾着吃。先不改，至少这顿饭看着挺香。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-history-20261108-03-04",
      "author": "visitor-chi-upper",
      "createdAt": "2026-01-26T22:18:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": "l0-history-20261108-03-03",
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "我家系带子的剪刀最后也在拆快递……室友说她以为是装饰"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-history-20261108-03-03",
      "author": "visitor-tau-upper",
      "createdAt": "2026-01-26T17:10:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "给家里又添了把剪布的剪刀，系了条红布做记号。旧的那把搬去厨房，谁要拆袋子就用它。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-history-20261108-03-02",
      "author": "visitor-lambda-upper",
      "createdAt": "2026-01-09T18:43:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": "l0-history-20261108-03-01",
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "先拿纸剪个圆放桌上比一下吧。量着合适不一定看着合适，我做抽屉隔板也返工过。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-history-20261108-03-01",
      "author": "visitor-omega-upper",
      "createdAt": "2026-01-08T20:12:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "给小厨房做了三个碗，全是歪的。已经够小了，放到桌上还是像洗脸盆。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-history-20261108-02-08",
      "author": "lidianlong",
      "createdAt": "2025-12-14T22:32:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "刚吃完，路过烤串摊又坐下了。这个味儿真没法忍。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-history-20261108-02-07",
      "author": "anmianyao",
      "createdAt": "2025-11-23T23:51:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "录音里有一声猫叫。先留着，明天再听。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-history-20261108-02-06",
      "author": "zhaoyangxue",
      "createdAt": "2025-10-19T12:37:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": "l0-history-20261108-02-05",
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "先别继续搓啦，我以前一块布就是这样搓起毛的。你那个是浅色桌布吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-history-20261108-02-05",
      "author": "baiyanyan",
      "createdAt": "2025-10-18T19:42:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "上次买的那副牌掉色了，洗了两遍桌布还有印子。啧，店家怎么还敢说是正常现象。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-history-20261108-02-04",
      "author": "guyu",
      "createdAt": "2025-10-12T17:09:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "有人会看完片尾再走吗？今天灯开了，收拾的人就站在旁边，我也不好意思继续坐着。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-history-20261108-02-03",
      "author": "visitor-phi-upper",
      "createdAt": "2025-09-29T20:17:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "下午把一卷拍了半年才拍完的胶卷送去洗。店里说三天后拿。我已经不记得前十张拍的是什么了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-history-20261108-02-02",
      "author": "lixing",
      "createdAt": "2025-09-14T10:56:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": "l0-history-20261108-02-01",
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "菜市场今天也开门。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-history-20261108-02-01",
      "author": "alan",
      "createdAt": "2025-09-14T07:23:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "出门前煮了几个鸡蛋，钓到现在一条鱼都没见着，鸡蛋倒是吃完了。等隔壁收竿，问问他桶里的鱼卖不卖。"
    },
    {
      "id": "l0-history-20261108-01-01",
      "author": "guyu",
      "createdAt": "2025-03-18T16:42:00+08:00",
      "replyTo": null,
      "likes": 0,
      "canon": "derivative",
      "media": [],
      "text": "课件打成黑白的了，四条曲线看起来一模一样。早知道至少把这两页单独打彩色。"
    }
  ]
}
